205
00:07:47,487 --> 00:07:49,225
In an axial flux motor,

206
00:07:49,225 --> 00:07:50,963
it runs along the axis,

207
00:07:50,963 --> 00:07:53,306
so the motor can be shaped like

208
00:07:53,306 --> 00:07:55,573
a thick disc instead of a long

209
00:07:55,573 --> 00:07:56,253
cylinder.

210
00:07:56,433 --> 00:07:58,562
That makes it short and compact,

211
00:07:58,562 --> 00:08:00,757
which is why McLaren could fit it

212
00:08:00,757 --> 00:08:03,085
between the engine and the gearbox.

213
00:08:03,436 --> 00:08:04,968
And here is what they share.

214
00:08:05,148 --> 00:08:07,516
