224
00:08:33,617 --> 00:08:37,455
InsideEVs listed the SF90's at seven point

225
00:08:37,455 --> 00:08:39,283
nine kilowatt hours.

226
00:08:39,463 --> 00:08:42,292
Wikipedia lists the Artura's at about seven

227
00:08:42,292 --> 00:08:45,582
point four, weighing about eighty-eight kilograms.

228
00:08:45,762 --> 00:08:47,795
Neither car is trying to be an

229
00:08:47,795 --> 00:08:48,676
