232
00:08:53,537 --> 00:08:55,093
On electricity alone,

233
00:08:55,093 --> 00:08:57,465
the two cars behave differently,

234
00:08:57,465 --> 00:08:59,911
and this is the twist most people

235
00:08:59,911 --> 00:09:00,282
miss.

236
00:09:00,462 --> 00:09:03,457
The SF90's electric mode uses only its

237
00:09:03,457 --> 00:09:06,058
front motors, InsideEVs reported.

238
00:09:06,238 --> 00:09:07,281
So in eDrive,

239
00:09:07,281 --> 00:09:11,615
a mid-engined Ferrari becomes a front-wheel-drive car,

240
00:09:11,615 --> 00:09:14,986
with up to about twenty-five kilometers of

241
00:09:14,986 --> 00:09:17,393
range and a top speed of about

242
00:09:17,393 --> 00:09:20,925
one hundred thirty-five kilometers per hour.

243
00:09:21,275 --> 00:09:24,291
The Artura's electric mode uses its rear

244
00:09:24,291 --> 00:09:27,307
